WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:47.187 --> 00:01:48.677
Oops!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.792
Oh, no!

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:54.317
Ow!

00:01:57.464 --> 00:02:02.902
If I don't learn how to cook a
little, I might starve to death...

00:02:04.404 --> 00:02:07.805
I sure miss Sasami's home cooking...

00:02:10.777 --> 00:02:13.146
Okay, Ryo-Ohki! Let's get cooking!

00:02:13.146 --> 00:02:14.080
"Dinner With Sasami & Ryo-Ohki"
Okay, Ryo-Ohki! Let's get cooking!

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:14.546
"Dinner With Sasami & Ryo-Ohki"

00:02:18.585 --> 00:02:20.576
No nibbling!

00:02:21.888 --> 00:02:24.558
Tonight, we're having a
terrific steak of Japanese beef!

00:02:24.558 --> 00:02:26.719
And for the garnish... carrots!

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:27.828
"Dinner With Sasami & Ryo-Ohki"

00:02:27.828 --> 00:02:30.030
"Dinner With Sasami & Ryo-Ohki"
Flip the steak...

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.732
...and the steak is done!

00:02:32.732 --> 00:02:35.223
And next up is a delicious <i>miso</i> soup!

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.507
Dinner's ready!

00:02:58.725 --> 00:03:01.228
I am absolute and unique.

00:03:01.228 --> 00:03:03.997
Creator of all, and its ruler.

00:03:03.997 --> 00:03:08.798
Ye who shall obey my will!
My agents! Be ye born here now!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:31.413
Pleased to meet you, my darling servants...

00:03:45.539 --> 00:03:47.803
H-Hello? Who is it?

00:03:50.243 --> 00:03:52.734
Masaki! Good morning!

00:03:55.015 --> 00:03:59.920
W-What're you doing here,
Kumashiro? It's Sunday morning!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.922
I can't come over without a reason?

00:04:01.922 --> 00:04:03.856
That's not what I meant...

00:04:05.191 --> 00:04:09.563
Actually, I thought I'd show you around Tokyo.

00:04:09.563 --> 00:04:15.101
You just transferred here,
so you don't know Tokyo yet, right?

00:04:15.101 --> 00:04:17.501
Well... Yeah, I suppose not.

00:04:17.938 --> 00:04:20.607
So, Masaki... Have you had breakfast yet?

00:04:20.607 --> 00:04:22.208
No, not yet.

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:24.369
Then I'll make it for you!

00:04:29.516 --> 00:04:33.043
T-Tokyo sure has it all, huh?

00:04:35.422 --> 00:04:39.859
But there's so much that it's
hard to pick out the good stuff.

00:04:39.859 --> 00:04:44.831
I mean, I went to five
convenience stores to get all this.

00:04:44.831 --> 00:04:46.560
Th-Thanks.

00:04:50.103 --> 00:04:51.237
Go on, eat!

00:04:51.237 --> 00:04:53.330
Sure. It looks great.

00:04:53.907 --> 00:04:54.741
How is it?

00:04:54.741 --> 00:04:55.642
It's great!

00:04:55.642 --> 00:04:56.576
Isn't it, though?

00:04:56.576 --> 00:04:59.245
You keep eating, and I'll make some tea.

00:04:59.245 --> 00:05:00.769
Thanks.

00:05:08.254 --> 00:05:10.724
What's that bimbo
doing in Tenchi's room?!

00:05:10.724 --> 00:05:11.958
I've no idea!

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:16.327
And here I had hoped to go
see Tenchi because it's Sunday!

00:05:18.064 --> 00:05:21.267
Sister! Ryoko! Breakfast is ready!

00:05:21.267 --> 00:05:23.827
We've got more important
things to worry about!

00:05:29.376 --> 00:05:33.313
That newlywed wife routine
makes me so jea-sick to my stomach!

00:05:33.313 --> 00:05:36.416
Hey, Tenchi, what's with the blushing?!

00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:38.284
Hey, you! Get away from him!

00:05:38.284 --> 00:05:40.854
Right! Tenchi's mine!

00:05:40.854 --> 00:05:44.424
You've gone too far! To sneak in
and steal him away like some thief!

00:05:44.424 --> 00:05:47.627
Get away from my Tenchi!

00:05:47.627 --> 00:05:49.529
Hey! Be careful!

00:05:49.529 --> 00:05:50.826
What're you doing?!

00:05:52.432 --> 00:05:54.968
Ayeka! Le-Leggo!

00:05:54.968 --> 00:05:57.198
I'm not going to let go!

00:05:58.905 --> 00:05:59.906
Is someone here?

00:05:59.906 --> 00:06:03.276
N-No! It's the TV next door.

00:06:03.276 --> 00:06:07.614
The walls here are pretty thin,
so it sounds like it's in the same room.

00:06:07.614 --> 00:06:09.309
Really?

00:06:12.318 --> 00:06:15.522
If we stay here, it's gonna get nasty...

00:06:15.522 --> 00:06:18.258
Good morning!

00:06:18.258 --> 00:06:20.093
What are you doing?

00:06:20.093 --> 00:06:22.762
Washu! Just the person we wanted to see!

00:06:22.762 --> 00:06:25.832
Is there some way you
might be able to open this?

00:06:25.832 --> 00:06:28.027
Lt'll only open this far!

00:06:29.569 --> 00:06:31.404
The Dimension Tunnel?

00:06:31.404 --> 00:06:32.972
Forget about it.

00:06:32.972 --> 00:06:36.976
Until it's opened from the
other end, it can't be used.

00:06:36.976 --> 00:06:39.638
All right, then! I'll blast my way through!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.373
J-Just a moment! Ryoko!

00:06:43.183 --> 00:06:45.618
W-Wait! Ryoko!

00:06:45.618 --> 00:06:47.020
Don't! Don't do it!

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:51.013
Eat this! <i>Full Power!</i>

00:07:01.301 --> 00:07:06.136
I told you, didn't I?
What a waste of power...

00:07:10.744 --> 00:07:13.880
T-Tenchi...

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.348
Tried to force their way through, huh?

00:07:17.851 --> 00:07:19.853
Well, Masaki? Shall we go?

00:07:19.853 --> 00:07:21.684
Huh? Uh, sure...

00:07:24.324 --> 00:07:27.227
I'll show you around Harajuku!

00:07:27.227 --> 00:07:29.161
Kumashiro!

00:07:39.539 --> 00:07:42.702
I knew these wouldn't work...

00:07:44.978 --> 00:07:46.741
Right!

00:07:48.348 --> 00:07:50.748
Perfect timing, Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:53.887 --> 00:07:56.356
Hey! Once you're through,
pull the cover onto the bed!

00:07:56.356 --> 00:07:57.687
Got it?

00:07:59.492 --> 00:08:02.655
Come on! Go! Go!

00:08:07.867 --> 00:08:09.235
Having fun?

00:08:09.235 --> 00:08:10.570
Yeah, sure!

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:11.237
"Monster Busters"
Yeah, sure!

00:08:11.237 --> 00:08:11.871
"Monster Busters"
Great!

00:08:11.871 --> 00:08:12.565
Great!

00:08:21.247 --> 00:08:24.083
Come on, Ryo-Ohki!
Don't be such a crybaby!

00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:27.153
Just a little more, and
it will all be over, Ryo-Ohki!

00:08:27.153 --> 00:08:31.991
Stop! Sister! Ryoko!
You're hurting Ryo-Ohki!

00:08:31.991 --> 00:08:34.327
Please, Washu! Make 'em stop!

00:08:34.327 --> 00:08:36.921
I keep telling 'em it won't work...

00:08:53.379 --> 00:08:54.881
This way! This way!

00:08:54.881 --> 00:08:57.350
Let's go this way! It's a shortcut.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.215
Really?

00:09:12.198 --> 00:09:14.564
Wow, I didn't know there
were places like this in Tokyo...

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.670
What? Where'd this fog come from?

00:09:25.478 --> 00:09:28.038
K-Kumashiro! Look!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.128
What a great mansion!

00:09:42.128 --> 00:09:46.065
But I don't remember
there being a mansion here...

00:09:46.065 --> 00:09:48.863
What do you think the
people who live here are like?

00:09:49.435 --> 00:09:53.706
I don't know, but they must be really rich.

00:09:53.706 --> 00:09:57.076
Yeah, you're right!
Wanna take a peek inside?

00:09:57.076 --> 00:09:59.442
B-But if somebody sees us,
we'll be in big trouble!

00:10:01.014 --> 00:10:02.572
K-Kumashiro!

00:10:11.891 --> 00:10:14.451
Come on, Kumashiro, this isn't a good idea...

00:10:24.637 --> 00:10:27.606
Welcome to the Manor of Vows.

00:10:49.896 --> 00:10:52.465
We're sorry! We shouldn't have snuck in!

00:10:52.465 --> 00:10:53.866
We'll leave right away!

00:10:53.866 --> 00:10:55.902
We're sorry!

00:10:55.902 --> 00:10:57.971
No, that's quite all right.

00:10:57.971 --> 00:11:01.908
Actually, a party is about to begin.
Would you like to come?

00:11:01.908 --> 00:11:04.210
If you like, you're welcome to attend.

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.905
A party?!

00:11:06.779 --> 00:11:10.049
I'm sorry, I haven't
introduced myself. I'm Hotsuma.

00:11:10.049 --> 00:11:11.751
I'm the lord of the manor.

00:11:11.751 --> 00:11:13.853
And now, if you'll please follow me...

00:11:13.853 --> 00:11:15.684
B-But...

00:11:36.442 --> 00:11:38.740
This place is amazing!

00:11:42.749 --> 00:11:46.185
People call it the Manor of Vows.

00:11:46.185 --> 00:11:49.455
Long ago, nobility lived here.

00:11:49.455 --> 00:11:53.760
Once, one of the daughters
fell in love with a servant boy.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:57.163
However, the difference in
their stations was too great.

00:11:57.163 --> 00:12:01.501
It was widely opposed, and, realizing
they would never be united in this life,

00:12:01.501 --> 00:12:06.606
they pledged their eternal
love here and took their own lives.

00:12:06.606 --> 00:12:08.041
How sad...

00:12:08.041 --> 00:12:11.310
Perhaps it is the spirits of
those two who could not be united,

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:15.181
but ever since, couples who pledge
their love here are bound together,

00:12:15.181 --> 00:12:18.718
and are able to obtain eternal love.

00:12:18.718 --> 00:12:21.186
Really? Eternal love?

00:12:22.588 --> 00:12:27.827
Because of this, people call
this place the Manor of Vows.

00:12:27.827 --> 00:12:32.865
The rumors spread, and though
many couples search for this place,

00:12:32.865 --> 00:12:36.102
I'm told that only a handful ever find it.

00:12:36.102 --> 00:12:40.673
They say that only those who are with
their destined partner can find this place,

00:12:40.673 --> 00:12:43.242
and so, some call this
place the Phantom Manor.

00:12:43.242 --> 00:12:44.971
Oh...

00:12:46.212 --> 00:12:49.375
Well, then. We'll meet again later.

00:12:52.018 --> 00:12:53.610
Kumashiro!

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.154
Masaki!

00:12:55.154 --> 00:12:56.815
Kumashiro!

00:13:06.666 --> 00:13:08.968
Ryo-Ohki...

00:13:08.968 --> 00:13:11.904
Damn it, we're so close!

00:13:11.904 --> 00:13:13.769
If it's come to this, then...

00:13:21.114 --> 00:13:22.911
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:13:24.117 --> 00:13:26.119
Ryo-Ohki! Find Tenchi!

00:13:26.119 --> 00:13:27.720
We're counting on you!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.520
Ryo-Ohki! You must find Tenchi!

00:13:49.142 --> 00:13:52.478
It's unnaturally quiet somehow.

00:13:52.478 --> 00:13:54.912
Ryo-Ohki! Which way?

00:14:00.319 --> 00:14:01.980
That way?

00:14:03.523 --> 00:14:05.616
What's this?

00:14:20.006 --> 00:14:21.803
Masaki?

00:14:28.414 --> 00:14:31.284
Kumashiro? Why are you dressed like that?

00:14:31.284 --> 00:14:33.752
Me? What about you?

00:14:36.589 --> 00:14:39.392
H-Hotsuma! What's going on here?

00:14:39.392 --> 00:14:43.062
This is your wedding party.

00:14:43.062 --> 00:14:45.998
See? Your bride awaits.

00:14:45.998 --> 00:14:48.834
W-Wait a minute, Hotsuma!

00:14:48.834 --> 00:14:51.938
I thought I told you.
This is the Manor of Vows.

00:14:51.938 --> 00:14:54.507
Eternal love may be found here.

00:14:54.507 --> 00:14:59.278
Couples who are able to
find this place pledge their love,

00:14:59.278 --> 00:15:02.509
and that love becomes eternal.

00:15:07.887 --> 00:15:11.023
Oh, come on...
Where the heck are we?

00:15:11.023 --> 00:15:15.294
There's nothing but fog in
every direction. I can't see a thing.

00:15:15.294 --> 00:15:18.661
And what's that evil presence I feel?

00:15:21.334 --> 00:15:23.768
I've got a bad feeling about this...

00:15:26.305 --> 00:15:27.863
You found him?!

00:15:30.142 --> 00:15:33.179
Come, let's begin the exchange of vows.

00:15:33.179 --> 00:15:38.117
However, this is the Manor of Vows.
We've no need of formal ceremony here.

00:15:38.117 --> 00:15:44.290
Merely pledge your love to one other,
and eternal love shall be yours.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.190
Masaki...

00:15:48.094 --> 00:15:49.994
Kumashiro...

00:15:53.232 --> 00:15:55.635
Do you, Sakuya Kumashiro,

00:15:55.635 --> 00:16:00.940
pledge your eternal love to
your groom, Tenchi Masaki?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.675
I do.

00:16:02.675 --> 00:16:05.044
And do you, Tenchi Masaki,

00:16:05.044 --> 00:16:09.382
pledge your eternal love to
your bride, Sakuya Kumashiro?

00:16:09.382 --> 00:16:11.484
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:16:11.484 --> 00:16:14.153
What's going on here, Hotsuma?

00:16:14.153 --> 00:16:18.021
Why do Kumashiro and I have to get married?

00:16:19.225 --> 00:16:21.861
Do you pledge your love?

00:16:21.861 --> 00:16:23.852
Hotsuma!

00:16:30.836 --> 00:16:35.241
Do you pledge your love?

00:16:35.241 --> 00:16:39.268
Kumashiro... I...

00:16:46.786 --> 00:16:48.988
Tenchi's in there?!

00:16:48.988 --> 00:16:50.751
Got it!

00:16:53.693 --> 00:16:55.361
What are you doing?

00:16:55.361 --> 00:16:58.455
H-How come I can't pass through it?

00:17:02.468 --> 00:17:05.271
It's no use. It's locked.

00:17:05.271 --> 00:17:07.262
Ayeka! Move it!

00:17:13.245 --> 00:17:14.735
What?

00:17:19.919 --> 00:17:21.454
Tenchi! You in there?

00:17:21.454 --> 00:17:23.155
Lord Tenchi!

00:17:23.155 --> 00:17:26.459
Ryoko? Ayeka? Ryo-Ohki?

00:17:26.459 --> 00:17:30.463
- I finally found you, Tenchi!
- I finally found you, Lord Tenchi!

00:17:30.463 --> 00:17:35.167
L-L-Lord Tenchi!
What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:35.167 --> 00:17:39.372
Tenchi! You have me, don't you?!

00:17:39.372 --> 00:17:42.742
How come you're with
that seedy-lookin' bimbo?

00:17:42.742 --> 00:17:44.607
L-It's not what you think...

00:17:46.278 --> 00:17:49.281
Kumashiro! What're you
doing to her, Hotsuma?!

00:17:49.281 --> 00:17:51.984
I thought I told you.
This is the Manor of Vows.

00:17:51.984 --> 00:17:56.478
I give eternal suffering to those
who don't pledge eternal love!

00:17:57.923 --> 00:17:59.291
Masaki!

00:17:59.291 --> 00:18:01.761
Ryoko! Ayeka! Give me a hand!

00:18:01.761 --> 00:18:03.696
We've got to save Kumashiro!

00:18:03.696 --> 00:18:07.199
How come I gotta help that bimbo?

00:18:07.199 --> 00:18:09.268
She's right!

00:18:09.268 --> 00:18:12.872
Come on, Tenchi, lose the floozy,

00:18:12.872 --> 00:18:16.575
and then we can spend a
night all alone in the big city...

00:18:16.575 --> 00:18:18.440
Let Kumashiro go!

00:18:20.613 --> 00:18:23.883
I think not. She's coming with me.

00:18:23.883 --> 00:18:28.115
You'll spend the rest of your life
regretting that you couldn't save her!

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.617
Masaki!

00:18:34.193 --> 00:18:35.854
Masaki!

00:18:42.501 --> 00:18:46.405
Bastard! You just had to go
and hit my Tenchi, didn't you?

00:18:46.405 --> 00:18:51.138
I don't know who you are, but no
one gets away with hurting Tenchi!

00:18:52.778 --> 00:18:54.268
Silence!

00:18:55.648 --> 00:18:57.878
How dare you hurt Tenchi!

00:19:02.354 --> 00:19:04.254
How's it feel to be on the receiving end?

00:19:06.459 --> 00:19:08.222
Masaki?

00:19:14.066 --> 00:19:15.431
What?

00:19:20.206 --> 00:19:22.299
W-Wow!

00:19:23.375 --> 00:19:25.275
You're pretty good...

00:19:26.512 --> 00:19:28.207
You, too.

00:19:46.232 --> 00:19:48.467
What's your name?

00:19:48.467 --> 00:19:51.337
Ryoko. What's yours, bastard?

00:19:51.337 --> 00:19:54.273
Hotsuma. You know, I like you.

00:19:54.273 --> 00:19:59.311
Come back here some day. And
then we'll settle things once and for all.

00:19:59.311 --> 00:20:01.074
Hotsuma, huh?

00:20:04.917 --> 00:20:07.715
Lord Tenchi! Are you hurt?

00:20:08.988 --> 00:20:10.789
Tenchi? You okay?

00:20:10.789 --> 00:20:12.992
Thanks. I'm okay.

00:20:12.992 --> 00:20:15.694
Amazing! That was so amazing!

00:20:15.694 --> 00:20:18.831
Masaki, who are these people?

00:20:18.831 --> 00:20:22.096
Huh? Well, uh...

00:20:23.469 --> 00:20:27.769
Oh, right! Allow me to introduce
the cast of the Monster Busters game!

00:20:29.174 --> 00:20:31.608
- "Monster Busters"?
- "Monster Busters"?

00:20:34.113 --> 00:20:35.214
Wow!

00:20:35.214 --> 00:20:39.318
Nice to meet you!
My name's Sakuya Kumashiro!

00:20:39.318 --> 00:20:42.481
Thanks for saving us.

00:20:43.355 --> 00:20:46.449
So, you must be Miss One...

00:20:48.294 --> 00:20:51.797
...and you're Miss Two, right?

00:20:51.797 --> 00:20:53.287
Can I shake your hand?

00:20:57.369 --> 00:20:59.667
W-What's with this girl?

00:21:02.675 --> 00:21:04.973
Wh-What a strange girl...

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.812
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.812 --> 00:21:43.716
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.716 --> 00:21:47.319
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.319 --> 00:21:51.256
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.256 --> 00:21:54.760
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:58.731
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.731 --> 00:22:02.067
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.067 --> 00:22:06.071
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.071 --> 00:22:08.207
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.207 --> 00:22:10.142
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.142 --> 00:22:11.644
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.644 --> 00:22:17.483
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.483 --> 00:22:21.587
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.587 --> 00:22:24.857
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.857 --> 00:22:28.394
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.394 --> 00:22:33.093
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:42.941 --> 00:22:45.444
Hi! Washu here!

00:22:45.444 --> 00:22:49.148
Hm? You want money, and
you want me to help you get it?

00:22:49.148 --> 00:22:53.752
I'm a genius scientist, not a miracle worker!

00:22:53.752 --> 00:22:59.224
Now's your chance to go to Tokyo!
Get jobs! You know, work?

00:22:59.224 --> 00:23:03.929
Hey, you! Wipe that look of
disgust off your face! Get going!

00:23:03.929 --> 00:23:10.926
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Money! Money! Money!"
